  message: "Its four artifacts are now WI-kurod (P1), which carries the ADR, the io_boundary_types.py registry, scripts/check-io-boundary-drift, the property test and the _known_axes wiring. IoPrimitive.boundary's own axis comment is NOT in WI-kurod: it needs WI-mubup, which widens the linter to io_boundary.py, because DEFAULT_CORE_FILES is ir.py and datamodels.py only and cannot see the catalogue dataclass. This item stays violated until both land, and per its own sequencing note it precedes the WI-hazop census and the WI-nosah retag rather than following them."  # 3cf6
